      <li><a href="/species/thick-billed-raven/">Thick-billed Raven — species hub</a></li>
      <li><a href="/species/thick-billed-raven/diet/">Thick-billed Raven diet</a></li>
      <li><a href="/questions/when-do-ravens-nest/">When do ravens nest?</a></li>
